.TH SAMPLE-TOOL 1 "" "zstaller sample" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sample-tool \- print the SHA-256 of files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sample-tool
.RI [ file ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
With no arguments,
.B sample-tool
prints its version. Otherwise it prints the SHA-256 of each
.I file
in the format of
.BR sha256sum (1).
It is the second program of the zstaller sample, packaged with
.B programs
in build.zig.
